    <div class="u-container u-container--narrow support-article_body">
    <article class="entry entry--solo entry--support-article">
      <header class="entry_header">
        <h1 class="title-page entry_title">IPs for Firewalls</h1>
      </header>

      <div class="scope-text scope-text--help-scout">
        <p>Below is a list of IPs you can add to your firewall for sending email through SMTP, Inbound processing and Webhooks.</p>
<h2 id="outbound">Outbound SMTP Servers</h2>
<p>The IP addresses that Transactional and Broadcast messages are sent from.</p>
<ul>
<li>50.31.156.96/27 (50.31.156.96 - 127) [Transactional]</li>
<li>104.245.209.192/26 (104.245.209.192 - 255) [Transactional]</li>
<li>50.31.205.204/30 (50.31.205.204 - 207) [Transactional]</li>
<li>
<div>50.31.205.0/24 (50.31.205.1 - 255) [Broadcast]</div>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="smtp">SMTP Endpoints</h2>
<p>The IP endpoints for accessing SMTP outbound.</p>
<h3 id="h_01JPJF9Q5NA3H83MDV8829P9GM">CIDR Blocks / Ranges</h3>
<ul>
<li>147.75.195.176/30 [147.75.195.176 - 147.75.195.179]</li>
<li>147.75.202.84/30 [147.75.202.84 -147.75.202.87]</li>
<li>147.75.205.84/30 [147.75.205.84 - 147.75.205.87]</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>52.79.88.220</li>
<li>54.180.186.193</li>
<li>34.249.162.51</li>
<li>52.208.184.61</li>
<li>63.35.51.189</li>
<li>3.208.98.158</li>
<li>3.93.205.235</li>
<li>3.95.122.1</li>
<li>3.208.98.158</li>
<li>3.93.205.235</li>
<li>3.95.122.1</li>
<li>13.209.189.43</li>
<li>15.164.159.110</li>
<li>52.208.94.138</li>
<li>52.210.34.36</li>
<li>54.77.222.65</li>
</ul>
<p>Note: IP allowlisting for our API is no longer supported. <a href="https://postmarkapp.com/updates/static-ip-deprecation-postmark-will-no-longer-support-ip-allow-listing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more</a></p>
<h2 id="inbound">Inbound SMTP Servers</h2>
<p>These IPs are where Postmark's inbound MX record points.</p>
<ul>
<li>13.58.75.120</li>
<li>52.36.8.247</li>
<li>18.221.96.15</li>
<li>34.211.250.229</li>
<li>34.211.88.250</li>
<li>18.221.180.145</li>
<li>52.210.157.196</li>
<li>52.213.211.243</li>
<li>52.51.73.41</li>
<li>13.125.126.102</li>
<li>3.34.204.228</li>
<li>3.34.213.247</li>
<li>107.22.71.110</li>
<li>52.2.5.255</li>
<li>72.44.42.226</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="webhooks">Webhooks</h2>
<p>These IPs apply for every webhook sent by Postmark (inbound, bounce, open, etc).</p>
<ul>
<li>3.134.147.250</li>
<li>50.31.156.6</li>
<li>50.31.156.77</li>
<li>18.217.206.57</li>
</ul>
      </div>

      <footer class="entry_footer">
        Last updated March 17th, 2025
      </footer>
    </article>

    
      
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
  

  
